      "source": [
        "# Bytes-like object\n",
        "\n",
        "A bytes-like object supports the buffer protocol and can expose a contiguous buffer of bytes. Examples include `bytes`, `bytearray`, and suitable `memoryview` objects.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-bytes-like-object)"
      ]
    }
